					<title>when you’re on your profile and you’re looking at your post, the music plays from the beginning</title>
				
					<content type="text">I literally love using Instagram so much to post my pictures and other things, but I really, really don’t like that whenever I’m looking at a profile or my profile, the music plays from the beginning and not from where it was picked from, and low-key it sounds bad because it’s just complete silence in the five seconds in the beginning. I really hope they fix that issue because it’s so small for them to fix</content>
				
